{"ann__mimics__the_functional_architecture_of_neurons": "The term \"mimics\" in this context refers to how ANNs are designed to emulate or replicate the operational and structural aspects of biological neurons. This emulation allows ANNs to process information in a way that is somewhat analogous to how the human brain functions."},
{"the_functional_architecture_of_neurons": "The functional architecture of neurons refers to the way neurons in the human brain are structured and operate, including input layers that receive information and output layers that send processed information. ANNs are designed to replicate this architecture to facilitate complex decision-making processes."},
