{"algorithms__can_be__uni_or_multi_objective": "The predicate \"can be\" indicates the flexibility or capability of the algorithms to operate in different modes or with different objectives. In this context, it highlights that the algorithms have the ability to function either with a single objective or with multiple objectives in mind."},
