{"https_doi_org_10_1016_j_hbpd_2022_03_001__has_all_rights_reserved__true": "The predicate \"has_all_rights_reserved\" indicates that the publication retains all intellectual property rights. This means that the authors and/or publishers maintain exclusive control over the reproduction, distribution, and adaptation of the content."},
