{"hepatobiliary_pancreatic_diseases_international_21_2022_347_353": "Hepatobiliary & Pancreatic Diseases International 21 (2022) 347\u2013353 is a specific issue and page range of an academic journal focused on diseases related to the liver, biliary system, and pancreas.|Here is another description: Hepatobiliary & Pancreatic Diseases International 21 (2022) 347\u2013353 is a scholarly article published in the journal Hepatobiliary & Pancreatic Diseases International, volume 21, in the year 2022, spanning pages 347 to 353. This article likely discusses topics related to hepatobiliary and pancreatic diseases.|Here is another description: Hepatobiliary & Pancreatic Diseases International 21 (2022) 347\u2013353 is a scientific publication in the field of hepatobiliary and pancreatic diseases, with the specific article appearing in volume 21 of the journal in 2022, spanning pages 347 to 353."},
{"r_calleja": "R. Calleja is an author who has contributed to scholarly work in the field of hepatobiliary and pancreatic diseases."},
{"r_calleja__co_author__hepatobiliary_pancreatic_diseases_international_21_2022_347_353": "The predicate \"co-author\" indicates a collaborative effort in the creation of a scholarly publication, where R. Calleja worked alongside other authors to produce the work."},
{"c_herv\u00e1s": "C. Herv\u00e1s is an author who has contributed to academic publications, specifically in the field of hepatobiliary and pancreatic diseases."},
