{"if_only_both_algorithms_are_obtained": "The object describes the condition under which the two problems occur: \"if only both algorithms are obtained.\" This means that the issues arise specifically when both the ANN-CCR (Artificial Neural Network for graft survival) and ANN-MS (Artificial Neural Network for minimum sensitivity) algorithms are applied and their results are considered together."},
