{"ann_ms__had_an_auc_of__0_82_for_12_months": "The phrase \"had an AUC of\" indicates the performance metric of the ANN-MS model in predicting graft loss. AUC, or Area Under the Curve, is a measure of the model's ability to distinguish between positive and negative outcomes, with higher values indicating better predictive performance."},
