{"the_field_of_organ_transplantation": "The field of organ transplantation involves medical procedures where organs are transferred from one body to another to replace damaged or non-functional organs. It is a critical area of medicine that benefits from technological advancements, including the integration of AI-based models to improve patient outcomes and operational efficiency."},
{"ai_based_models__are_used_in__the_prediction_of_graft_and_recipient_survival": "The phrase \"are used in\" indicates the application or implementation of AI-based models within a specific context or domain. In this case, it highlights the practical utilization of these models for a particular purpose related to organ transplantation."},
{"the_prediction_of_graft_and_recipient_survival": "The prediction of graft and recipient survival involves forecasting the likelihood of success for both the transplanted organ (graft) and the patient (recipient) post-transplantation. This prediction is crucial for assessing the potential outcomes and making informed decisions in the field of organ transplantation."},
{"ai_based_models__are_used_in__the_assignment": "The phrase \"are used in\" indicates the application or implementation of AI-based models within a specific context or process. In this case, it highlights how these models are being integrated into the procedures related to organ transplantation."},
