{"ai_based_models__outperform__decision_making_process_based_on_lr_models": "The term \"outperform\" indicates that AI-based models achieve superior results or efficiency compared to traditional methods. In this context, it suggests that AI-based models provide more accurate or effective outcomes than the decision-making process based on LR (Logistic Regression) models."},
