{"aucs_ranging_from_0_847_to_0_871": "AUCs ranging from 0.847 to 0.871 represent the Area Under the Curve values produced by the ANNs models. These values are a measure of the models' predictive accuracy, with higher AUCs indicating better performance in distinguishing between different outcomes, such as predicting death by graft failure within the first post-transplantation year."},
