{"results": "The results refer to the outcomes or findings related to a particular process or situation, in this case, likely pertaining to medical procedures or treatments."},
{"results__are_overshadowed_by__long_waiting_lists_and_mortality_of_candidates": "The phrase \"are overshadowed by\" indicates that the results, though present, are significantly diminished in importance or noticeability due to the presence of more pressing or severe issues."},
{"long_waiting_lists_and_mortality_of_candidates": "Long waiting lists and the mortality of candidates refer to critical issues in the medical field where patients awaiting treatment or transplantation face extended wait times and, unfortunately, some do not survive the wait, highlighting a severe disparity between demand and available resources."},
