{"simplification__allows_to_establish__some_clarity_within_the_scientific_method": "Allows to establish signifies the capability or function that enables the creation, setting up, or confirmation of a particular condition, relationship, or understanding. In this context, it describes how simplification facilitates the establishment of clarity within the scientific method."},
{"some_clarity_within_the_scientific_method": "Some clarity within the scientific method refers to a degree of understanding or transparency achieved in the processes, principles, or outcomes of scientific inquiry. It implies that through simplification, certain aspects of the scientific method become more comprehensible or discernible."},
