{"medical_problems": "Medical problems refer to health issues or conditions that affect individuals, requiring diagnosis, treatment, and management. These problems can range from minor ailments to severe, life-threatening diseases.|Here is another description: Medical problems refer to health issues or conditions that affect individuals, often requiring diagnosis, treatment, and management by healthcare professionals. These problems can range from minor ailments to severe, life-threatening diseases."},
