{"variables__with_a_high_percentage_of_missing_values__10_should_be_eliminated": "The phrase \"with a high percentage of missing values\" indicates a condition where certain variables have more than 10% of their data points missing, which is considered significant enough to affect the reliability of the predictive model."},
