{"90_10_training_testing": "The 90%/10% training-testing split represents an alternative configuration where 90% of the data is used for training the model, and 10% is reserved for testing. This configuration can be chosen based on the prevalence of the objective being analyzed, such as the survival of the recipient and graft in medical studies."},
