{"model__tries_to_maximize__probability_that_a_d_r_pair_belongs_to_the_non_surviving_class": "The model's primary function is to optimize its predictions by maximizing certain probabilities associated with the D-R pairs. Specifically, it aims to enhance the accuracy of its predictions regarding whether a D-R pair will fall into the 'non-surviving class,' which indicates a less favorable outcome for the transplant."},
