{"ann_methodology__validation__external_database": "Validation in this context means testing the ANN methodology to ensure its accuracy and reliability when applied to new, unseen data."},
{"external_database": "The external database, specifically King\u2019s College Hospital (KCH), serves as an independent dataset used to validate the ANN methodology, ensuring that the model performs well on data it has not been trained on.|Here is another description: The external database refers to a dataset that is not part of the primary study but is used for validation purposes. In this context, it is utilized to test the artificial neural network (ANN) methodology."},
