{"king_s_college_hospital_kch": "King\u2019s College Hospital (KCH) is a renowned medical institution where the external database used for validation is located. It is a place where medical data, including those used for research and validation of methodologies like ANN, are collected and stored."},
{"db": "DB is an abbreviation used in the context of the validation of ANN methodology in an external database, specifically at King\u2019s College Hospital (KCH)."},
