{"future_barriers__are_related_to__the_implementation_of_ai_models_in_d_r_matching": "The phrase \"are related to\" indicates a connection or association between the subject and the object. In this context, it signifies that the future barriers have a direct impact on or are associated with the process of implementing AI models in D-R matching."},
{"the_implementation_of_ai_models_in_d_r_matching": "The implementation of AI models in D-R matching involves the use of artificial intelligence technologies to improve the matching process between organ donors and recipients. This process is crucial for ensuring the success and efficiency of organ transplantations, and the integration of AI aims to enhance decision-making and outcomes."},
